    {
      "source": "Found it. The test cuts the link **before the relay has acknowledged the hello**, so on a slow runner the reconnect races the first handshake.\n\n- `reconnect_after_cut` sleeps 50 ms instead of waiting for the link to settle\n- on CI the hello takes up to 80 ms\n\nThe fix is to wait on the settled event:\n\n```rust\nlink.settled().await;\nrelay.cut(&link);\n```",
